  <!-- Raise Undead -->
  <!--原中文: '死者苏生', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Raise Undead',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Raise Undead-->
  <TM_RaiseUndead.label>死者苏生</TM_RaiseUndead.label>
  <!--原中文: '将生物的尸体复活为亡灵，亡灵会一直受制于死灵法师。\n  \n但是控制每一个不死人都需要死灵法师降低30%的基础魔法回复速度作为代价。维持不死动物只花费15%。\n\n死灵法师可以控制的亡灵没有上限，但当当死灵法师没有足够的法力维持它们时，失去控制的亡灵会被解散。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Raise undead from corpses. Only works on biological creatures that were once living. 

Undead will remain under the Necromancers control indefinitely. The necromancer will incur a mana upkeep cost of 30% of base mana regeneration for each undead, humanlike pawn. Undead animals incur an upkeep cost of 15% for every 100 combat power.

There is no limit to the number of undead a necromancer may control, however, when the necromancer no longer has mana to maintain undead, they will automatically be consumed until the number of active undead is reduced to a manageable amount.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Raise undead from corpses. Only works on biological creatures that were once living. 

Undead will remain under the Necromancers control indefinitely. The necromancer will incur a mana upkeep cost of 30% of base mana regeneration for each undead, humanlike pawn. Undead animals incur an upkeep cost of 15% for every 100 combat power.

There is no limit to the number of undead a necromancer may control, however, when the necromancer no longer has mana to maintain undead, they will automatically be consumed until the number of active undead is reduced to a manageable amount.-->
  <TM_RaiseUndead.description>将生物的尸体复活为亡灵，亡灵会一直受制于死灵法师。\n  \n但是控制每一个不死人都需要死灵法师降低30%的基础魔法回复速度作为代价。维持不死动物只花费15%。\n\n死灵法师可以控制的亡灵没有上限，但当当死灵法师没有足够的法力维持它们时，失去控制的亡灵会被解散。</TM_RaiseUndead.description>
  <!--原中文: '解散所有亡灵', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Dismiss Undead',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Dismiss Undead-->
  <TM_DismissUndead.label>解散所有亡灵</TM_DismissUndead.label>
  <!--原中文: '解散一名亡灵.', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Dismisses an undead.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Dismisses an undead.-->
  <TM_DismissUndead.description>解散一名亡灵.</TM_DismissUndead.description>
